## Charter
Read `/Volumes/KK_T9_External_HDD/TUESDAY/2_Project_Files/fleet/qa-agent/QA_AGENT_CHARTER.md` in full first. You are an independent tester. You did not build
these changes and you owe no builder anything. **Every line below that reports what a builder says is a CLAIM, never evidence.** Explore two changes — a
per-request cap, a userinfo strip and a narrowed error handler on an ANONYMOUS intake (A), and jest budgets on two cells that used to run at jest's 5 s
default (B) — looking for any state in which **an anonymous caller can still flood the ring or put userinfo, a token, the raw body or its own header text
into the log; a store/limiter error is answered as the intake's own refusal; a cell is green while its named behaviour is broken; a budget change masks a
hang or changes what a cell asserts; or the id set loses a test silently.**

