- **RD-723 is TIER 2 (through-code).** Verdict at **`19fc17c`**, plus its merged-tree result.
- **One verdict PER ticket, one report, one mail.** A finding on one ticket never becomes another's verdict.
- **TIER 1 AT FULL WEIGHT (RD-618) and TIER 2 AT THROUGH-CODE WEIGHT (RD-723), FINDINGS-ONLY:** no fixes, no pushes, no PRs, no deploys, nothing to Partner
  Center, the demo or production (§11).

